{"id": "1541603649388544112", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "1195174485859504171", "author_name": "601671_", "content": "Here's how she works\nRed stance- more damage\n\nBlue stance- more shield/heals\n\nYellow stance- more ult charge\n\nPurple stance-more strength gain, More poison/counter gained/applied\n\nYou enter the stance after using the card's respective stance first each turn \n\nThe bonus scales with her death resistance", "timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:22:31.625000+00:00"}
{"id": "1541603679403122739", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "1195174485859504171", "author_name": "601671_", "content": ".", "timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:22:38.781000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["473874815070109696"], "reply_to": "1541602184532074586"}
{"id": "1541603846298669076", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "1195174485859504171", "author_name": "601671_", "content": "That's the short of it, you mostly don't bother with changing stances most of the time after putting the one your team wants", "timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:23:18.572000+00:00"}
{"id": "1541603931602292867", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "939547142090018816", "author_name": "snorlax01", "content": "She's actually really easy\n\nStrike / Snarl Psalm \n- When placed into Ultra Space / played as the first Card in a Turn\n- L Changes Stance to Anger \n- L Raises the Final Damage of all Awakeners in your Team \n- L Grants additional Crit Rate & Crit Damage after casting Exalt\n- When played, applies Vulnerable\n\nDefense / Elegy Psalm \n- When placed into Ultra Space / played as the first Card in a Turn \n- L Changes Stance to Grief  \n- Raises the Shield Generation, Health Recovery and Strength Reduction of all Awakener in your Team \n- L Raises the Health Recovery provided by Exalt \n- When played, applies Weakness \n\n0-Cost / Carol Psalm\n- Choose an Awakener to grant Aliemus to", "timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:23:38.910000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["473874815070109696"], "reply_to": "1541602184532074586"}
{"id": "1541603970852593714", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "939547142090018816", "author_name": "snorlax01", "content": "This is all you need to know, ignore everything else", "timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:23:48.268000+00:00"}
{"id": "1541604018068005065", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "473874815070109696", "author_name": "jadeshadowolf13", "content": "So I just put her in a stance I want and never touch her cards again", "timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:23:59.525000+00:00"}
